Package: ISPAT3D
Type: Package
Title: Spatial Network Estimation in 3D Multiplexed Cancer Imaging
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Sagnik", "Bhadury", email = "bhadury@umich.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: ISPat-3D extends spatially varying conditional network
    estimation to volumetric (3D) or serial-section multiplexed tissue
    imaging. Gaussian process hyperparameters are estimated per marker per
    tumor-density zone via type-II marginal likelihood optimization; the
    resulting de-spatialised residuals are passed to a multi-study factor
    analysis to recover a shared cell-type interaction network and
    zone-specific interaction networks per spot/field of view.
